# ultrawidelock_cred role: credential key schedule and session-crypto composition.
# The primitive provider is a separate role because several consumers need the
# primitive contract without the credential stack. Consumers: the reader app,
# the Zephyr initiator and on-target test, and
# ports/esp32/components/ultrawidelock_crypto. Repo-root-relative, one path per
# line, sorted. To compile a file everywhere this role goes, add it HERE and
# nowhere else.
modules/ultrawidelock_cred/src/ultrawidelock_crypto.c
